<title>Southern Thailand: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/thailand/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-thailand-2026-10-21T07:52:24.310Z</guid>
<pubDate>Wed, 21 Oct 2026 07:52:24 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent attacks continue in the southern insurgency zone with pipe bombs wounding army officers and security volunteers in Narathiwat and Yala and grenade attacks in Trang, prompting arrests and seizure of explosives. A Chinese suspect was detained in Bangkok after attempting a 100,000 baht border crossing, and Malaysia appointed a new facilitator for southern Thailand peace talks. Cambodia and Thailand agreed on confidence-building measures at a UNCLOS meeting and discussed easing maritime border tensions. The WTO and multilateral partners reviewed progress on a supply-chain finance initiative. Flooding across Bangkok and 19 provinces killed 82 people, and there were 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.wto.org/english/news_e/news26_e/trfin_16oct26_517_e.htm&quot;&gt;World Trade Organization&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQYklrckN5SDRNSV8zYTlzLTVSbHBvVDR5aTlkLWNQbmh1Y2ZrcFVPVWJodHFaa3hwLVRHR1BiTUxHYk1ZdC1IaEQ1bm5WZ05nUDR1Q2RTZG90WGN3dXA1Rm92dUI4S2ozR3l3aW1IY0pUNW5WaktMQm1aZGNJMVI4UGxKaDYya001MXFUcnM2b2M0aU50TWxCaDhUcERrNTN0cFA5MllPMHM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxOc0tBQ0JJSm1BNlBHRWl4MmRPOW9MYk45RzR6WlpBclNwTmRsMWw3RFFsVzhGbE8zRjhTNEkwblNOTHpPaUxwaHF4dXo3YjhiWHpGc2dDYU9DeFlzNlBHNnlWYTVBYk11RjFwcEwwQjY1S1Z4M1ExN3VBaHRBQXNDN04wVWl4Unh6Y2FrZk90b2dFNW0tZ1E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khaosod English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNUWlxTTJzWVJyTEhaRVlUUFBUcTZDX09yUHFJQjNXYmpNVDF6YV91SzhVQlFQRHo3SDh6M0dCRjEwRy1lVVJ6RFZ2UWdtNFdobEN1QkpvanVXWWxsRjdsbGtpTXUxQU4xeC1uMG45dEtNTEtnZEN4ZUFTY283OW9TQkFRVlVxOHc4UnhKWk5rNWpqVTRwUUVlS3dFQXUta2V6QlBv?o